<section id="principles">
 <span class="eb">Aquemi design system · v1</span>
 <h1 class="dx">Precise, quiet, finished.</h1>
 <p class="lead">Aquemi designs and fabricates clean water systems for pharmaceutical manufacturing. The people we talk to are engineers, validation leads and quality managers who read specifications closely and answer to auditors. The brand should feel like the equipment: nothing extra.</p>
 <div class="principles">
  <div data-n="01"><h3 class="d3">Precision over persuasion</h3><p class="sm">Show the number, the standard and the method. Let the specification make the case.</p></div>
  <div data-n="02"><h3 class="d3">Space is a material</h3><p class="sm">Generous white space, few elements, square edges. A page should read like a clean room looks.</p></div>
  <div data-n="03"><h3 class="d3">One flowing line</h3><p class="sm">The swash from <i>e</i> into <i>m</i> is the single expressive gesture. Use it through the logo and the arc motif only.</p></div>
 </div>
</section>

<section id="logo">
 <span class="eb">Identity</span><h2 class="d1">Logo, mark and lockup</h2>
 <p class="lead">Three parts: the lowercase wordmark, the four-dot mark, and the lockup that pairs them. Use the supplied files; never redraw, recolour or re-letter them.</p>
 <div class="logos">
  <figure><div class="tile on-surface"><img src="brand/lockup-navy.svg" alt="Aquemi lockup, navy"></div><figcaption>lockup-navy.svg · on surface, raised, limestone · header on wide screens · min 140 px</figcaption></figure>
  <figure><div class="tile on-navy"><img src="brand/lockup-limestone.svg" alt="Aquemi lockup, limestone"></div><figcaption>lockup-limestone.svg · on navy only</figcaption></figure>
  <figure><div class="tile on-lime"><img src="brand/logo-navy.svg" alt="Aquemi wordmark, navy"></div><figcaption>logo-navy.svg · wordmark alone · phone navigation · min 96 px</figcaption></figure>
  <figure><div class="tile on-navy"><img src="brand/logo-limestone.svg" alt="Aquemi wordmark, limestone"></div><figcaption>logo-limestone.svg · footer at 160 px</figcaption></figure>
  <figure><div class="tile sq on-surface"><img src="brand/mark-navy.svg" alt="Aquemi mark, navy"></div><figcaption>mark-navy.svg · favicons, avatars, badges · min 16 px</figcaption></figure>
  <figure><div class="tile sq on-navy"><img src="brand/mark-limestone.svg" alt="Aquemi mark, limestone"></div><figcaption>mark-limestone.svg · on navy</figcaption></figure>
 </div>
 <ul class="rules">
  <li>Clear space equal to the height of the <i>a</i> around the wordmark and lockup; half the mark's width around the mark.</li>
  <li>Placement: top left in navigation at 112 px (wordmark) or 152 px (lockup); bottom left in the footer at 160 px.</li>
  <li>Don't stretch, outline, shadow, rotate or place the logo on <code>flow</code> or a busy image.</li>
 </ul>
</section>

<section id="colour">
 <span class="eb">Colour · tokens.json</span><h2 class="d1">Mostly neutral, one accent</h2>
 <p class="lead">Navy carries the brand, Limestone softens it, Flow Blue is the only accent. Each swatch shows the light value on the left and the dark-theme value on the right.</p>
 <div><div class="share" aria-label="Share of a typical page"><span style="flex:70;background:#FAF8F6" title="Surfaces 70%"></span><span style="flex:20;background:#0F2A47" title="Navy / action 20%"></span><span style="flex:8;background:#EBDFD6" title="Limestone 8%"></span><span style="flex:2;background:#24679A" title="Flow 2%"></span></div>
 <p class="sm" style="margin-top:8px">Share of a typical page: surfaces about 70% · navy and actions 20% · limestone 8% · flow 2% or less.</p></div>
 <div class="sw" id="swatches"><p class="sm">Loading tokens…</p></div>
 <ul class="rules">
  <li>Set text in <code>ink</code>; <code>ink-muted</code> for secondary copy; <code>ink-subtle</code> for metadata on surface and surface-raised only.</li>
  <li>Use <code>flow</code> as a line or a word: links, chart lines, one highlighted figure. Never a large fill, never a button.</li>
  <li>Status colours appear only in data and always with a word or icon.</li>
  <li>No gradients, no tinted shadows, no colour outside these tokens.</li>
 </ul>
</section>

<section id="type">
 <span class="eb">Typography · Geist and Geist Mono</span><h2 class="d1">Read in Geist, measure in Geist Mono</h2>
 <p class="lead">Headlines run light and tightly tracked; size and space make the hierarchy, not bold. 500 is the heaviest weight, for <code>h3</code> and <code>label</code> only. Every measurement is set in mono with tabular figures.</p>
 <div class="typ" id="typescale"></div>
</section>

