<section id="voice">
 <span class="eb">Voice and writing</span><h2 class="d1">Write like a senior process engineer</h2>
 <p class="lead">Plain, exact and confident without selling. We for Aquemi, you for the client. Lead with the outcome, then the evidence, and name the standard every time a claim depends on one.</p>
 <div class="aq-scroll"><table class="voice"><thead><tr><th>Write</th><th>Not</th></tr></thead><tbody>
  <tr><td>Every skid is factory acceptance tested before it ships.</td><td class="not">Our rigorous quality processes ensure excellence.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Hot water sanitization at 80 °C, no chemicals in the loop.</td><td class="not">Cutting-edge sanitization technology.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Validation documents follow GAMP 5 and arrive with the equipment.</td><td class="not">Seamless validation support!</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Conductivity holds below 1.1 µS/cm at 25 °C across the loop.</td><td class="not">Industry-leading water quality.</td></tr>
 </tbody></table></div>
 <ul class="rules">
  <li><b>Sentence case</b> for every heading, button and nav item. Uppercase only in the eyebrow style.</li>
  <li><b>Units:</b> a space between number and unit (80 °C, 1.1 µS/cm, 500 ppb TOC). SI units; imperial in brackets only on US-facing documents.</li>
  <li><b>Abbreviations:</b> spell out on first use per page, then abbreviate: Water for Injection (WFI), Purified Water (PW), Clean-in-place (CIP).</li>
  <li><b>Never write</b> revolutionary, world-class, cutting-edge, best-in-class, seamless or solutions-driven. No emoji, no exclamation marks.</li>
  <li><b>Placeholders:</b> on this draft, any fact only Aquemi can supply is written in <span class="ws" style="display:inline"><span class="ph">[square brackets]</span></span> until it is confirmed. Never publish an invented figure.</li>
 </ul>
</section>

<section id="imagery">
 <span class="eb">Imagery, motion, states</span><h2 class="d1">Imagery and motion</h2>
 <div class="principles">
  <div data-n="IMAGERY"><h3 class="d3">The work itself</h3><p class="sm">Electropolished 316L, orbital welds, sanitary valves, skids on the shop floor, installed loops. Cool, even light; true whites. Avoid lab-coat stock, splashing water, glowing molecules, globes and handshakes.</p></div>
  <div data-n="MOTION"><h3 class="d3">Steady flow</h3><p class="sm">200 ms for controls, 400–600 ms for section reveals, ease cubic-bezier(0.2, 0, 0, 1). Fade and move at most 16 px. Respect reduced motion.</p></div>
  <div data-n="STATES"><h3 class="d3">Visible focus</h3><p class="sm">A 2 px focus ring in <code>focus</code> with a 2 px offset on every interactive element. Primary hover shifts to <code>action-hover</code>; links underline on hover.</p></div>
 </div>
 <div class="stage" style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;min-height:200px"><div class="ws" style="background:none"><svg viewBox="0 0 420 300" style="position:absolute;right:-1px;bottom:-1px;width:min(50%,360px);height:auto" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M420 1.5 A 300 300 0 0 0 120 300" fill="none" style="stroke:var(--line-strong)" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M420 120 A 180 180 0 0 0 240 300" fill="none" style="stroke:var(--flow)" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></div>
  <p class="eb">The arc motif</p><p class="p" style="max-width:420px;margin-top:8px">Quarter-circle arcs in one 1.5 px stroke of <code>line-strong</code>, <code>flow</code>, or limestone on navy, cut at the edge of a band. At most one arc composition per screen. Never animated on a loop, never filled.</p></div>
 <p class="sm">Interface icons: none supplied yet. Until they are, use Lucide at a 1.5 px stroke, 20 px, coloured <code>ink</code> or <code>ink-muted</code>. Process diagrams use ISA-5.1 / P&amp;ID symbols.</p>
</section>

<p class="ftr">Source of truth: the Aquemi design system. Copies in this repo: <a href="design/tokens.json">design/tokens.json</a>, <a href="design/brand-book.md">design/brand-book.md</a>, <a href="design/website.md">design/website.md</a>. Styles: <a href="assets/aquemi.css">assets/aquemi.css</a>.</p>
</main>
